4-602.13 The following surfaces need cleaning attention:
1) within preparation coolers on cookline there is observed food splash and spill (mold observed on gaskets too);
2) underneath the flat top grill (accumulation of food soil and crumbs);
3) inside of freezer on cookline (crumbs and soil);
4) server area large unused prep cooler by in operation hand sink is soiled;  and
5) within back of low boys (splash and soil).
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
